{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Archipelago is a third-person base builder set among the stars. On the far frontier, your mission is clear: transform isolated worlds into thriving settlements to relieve the overpopulated Inner Sphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Among the Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on miniature planets and begin harvesting essential building materials including metals, minerals, and organics. Place buildings to obtain system resources such as water, food, energy, and infrastructure. Each planet is a complete, explorable, and small enough to quickly traverse (maybe even orbit), but vast enough to host your growing colony.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, manage resources, and nurture your population. As your community grows, new opportunities emerge. Unlock advanced structures by exploring new planets and grow your colony's\u00a0resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape a System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every settlement contributes to the larger star system you\u2019re developing. Expand beyond a single planet, creating interconnected colonies that work together and share resources to support your growing population.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove that your system can sustain life. Once your population reaches 100, you\u2019ll earn the right to construct a warp junction, a gateway that links your settlement to the wider galaxy, and invites future settlers to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore small, fully traversable planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between nearby planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manage building materials and system resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings as you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural solar systems \u2013  develop new systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295680?t=1759555738","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759555738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/ca517b8f5900b6fcf9d8a1f3070134f01539d45b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759555738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/ca517b8f5900b6fcf9d8a1f3070134f01539d45b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759555738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4082500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Archipelago is a third-person base builder set among the stars. On the far frontier, your mission is clear: transform isolated worlds into thriving settlements to relieve the overpopulated Inner Sphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Among the Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on miniature planets and begin harvesting essential building materials including metals, minerals, and organics. Place buildings to obtain system resources such as water, food, energy, and infrastructure. Each planet is a complete, explorable, and small enough to quickly traverse (maybe even orbit), but vast enough to host your growing colony.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, manage resources, and nurture your population. As your community grows, new opportunities emerge. Unlock advanced structures by exploring new planets and grow your colony's\u00a0resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape a System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every settlement contributes to the larger star system you\u2019re developing. Expand beyond a single planet, creating interconnected colonies that work together and share resources to support your growing population.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove that your system can sustain life. Once your population reaches 100, you\u2019ll earn the right to construct a warp junction, a gateway that links your settlement to the wider galaxy, and invites future settlers to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore small, fully traversable planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between nearby planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manage building materials and system resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings as you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural solar systems \u2013  develop new systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gogodinosaur"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/header.jpg?t=1759555738","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3295680/772578/089d61ac1ca83d4d55491a76ccb0512dfd9d058b/1750976669/dash_av1.mpd?t=1729702561","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3295680/772578/089d61ac1ca83d4d55491a76ccb0512dfd9d058b/1750976669/dash_h264.mpd?t=1729702561","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3295680/772578/089d61ac1ca83d4d55491a76ccb0512dfd9d058b/1750976669/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1729702561","id":257065610,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065610/movie480.mp4?t=1729702561","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065610/movie_max.mp4?t=1729702561"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer 01","